<%# The phone header's cost badge, wrapped in its own target so a ledger sweep can
    repaint it (Session#broadcast_cost). Rendered through a fresh view context each
    time, never through the process-wide `SessionsController.helpers`, whose
    `@session_cost_index` would otherwise pin the first figure forever. %>
<span id="session_<%= agent_session.id %>_cost_badge"><%= session_cost_badge(agent_session) %></span>
